# ─── Setup: GitHub Actions secrets (no VPS) ─────────────────────────────────
#
# 1. PER-REPO workflow (push-notify.yml → copy to each watched repo)
#    Repository secret name: DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL
#    Value: Discord channel webhook URL for that repo (Discord → Channel Settings
#    → Integrations → Webhooks → create new webhook)
#
# 2. HUB-REPO workflow (epoch-watch.yml → in fuego-suite)
#    Repository secrets:
#
#    FUEGO_RPC_URL
#      Fuego daemon JSON-RPC URL. Can be a public RPC endpoint or local
#      Default mainnet RPC: http://127.0.0.1:28180/json_rpc
#
#    MAINNET_WEBHOOK_URL
#      Discord webhook URL for the network end-of-epoch "Epoch Epics" channel
#
#    REPO_WEBHOOKS
#      JSON map of repo → channel webhook, e.g.:
#      {"usexfg/digm-platform":"https://discord.com/api/webhooks/...",
#       "usexfg/fuego-suite":"https://discord.com/api/webhooks/..."}
#
#    GEMINI_API_KEY (optional)
#      Google Gemini API key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#      Free tier: 60 req/min, 1000 req/day, 1M token context.
#      When set, commit summaries are AI-generated (Gemini 1.5 Flash).
#      Without it, raw commit listings are posted instead.
